  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CM02122",
    "sub_id": "59300",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. 本課程禁止學生有下列行為，例如上課喧嘩、玩遊戲、上網聊天等，若經3次提醒而仍舊故犯者，將視情況請學生離開教室。\n2. 本課程禁止學生在課堂上(包含實體或網路)，以任何形式干擾其他同學學習。",
    "course_pol_en": "1. This course prohibits students from engaging in the following behaviors: making noise in class, playing games, chatting via the Internet, etc. If the student still commits the same action after 3 reminders, the student will be asked to leave the classroom according to the situation.\n2. This course prohibits students from interfering with the learning of other students in any form in the classroom (including offline or online).",
    "course_rem": "課程提醒\n1. 本課程有許多適當之網路學習資源，請務必自主學習，以免無法跟上學習進度。\n2. 本課程期望學生主動學習參與，上台解答習題、回應問題、筆記整理、師生討論等各種主動學習均有助於期末成績。\n3. 本課程有相當多的學習資源，鼓勵同學主動尋找並學習。\n4. 勤做作業絕對有幫助。",
    "course_rem_en": "1. This course expects students to actively learn and participate. All kinds of active learning such as answering exercises, responding to questions, organizing notes, and discussing with teachers and students will contribute to the final grade.\n2. This course has quite a lot of learning resources, and students are encouraged to actively search and learn.\n3. Doing exercises frequently will definitely help.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. 本課程各項作業、報告是用以評量學生學習成果的方式，鼓勵學生盡力完成，並且期望同學間可以相互學習與討論，但不可有抄襲或違反學術倫理之狀況。</div>\n\n<div>2. 本課程各項作業、報告、或考試，若學生有明確抄襲或違反學術倫理之情況，課程期末成績將無法及格。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1. The assignments and reports of this course are used to evaluate students&#39; learning. Students are encouraged to do their best to complete them all, and students are expected to learn from and discuss with each other, however, no plagiarism or violation of academic ethics is allowed.</div>\n\n<div>2. If a student significantly plagiarizes or violates academic ethics in the assignments, reports, or exams of this course, the final grade of the course will not be passed.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>1. 本課程各項作業、報告是用以評量學生學習成果的方式，鼓勵學生盡力完成，並且期望同學間可以相互學習與討論，但不可有抄襲或違反學術倫理之狀況。</div>\n\n<div>2. 本課程各項作業、報告、或考試，若學生有明確抄襲或違反學術倫理之情況，課程期末成績將無法及格。</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "Y"
  },
